WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Send tokens with a link. Real Monad testnet demo. Wallet confirmations are automated.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Choose a token. Set the amount. Fund the link. 12.34 DEMOUSD: a six-decimal test token with no monetary value.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Open the link and claim the payment. The transaction receipt confirms the token transfer.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Save the wallets you send to. Contacts are private. Unlock them with a wallet signature.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Sharing with a group? Choose Lucky Link. Set the pool, recipient slots, and eligible wallets.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:01.000
One random share per eligible wallet. Pyth Entropy settles the draw. Fees and gas are paid in MON.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Reveal the amount. Collect your share. This is a real testnet withdrawal. Confirmation waits are shortened.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Every link, in one place. Track Payment and Lucky Links. Refund available funds after expiry.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Create a link. Send it in a chat. Try MonliPay at monlipay.xyz


00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Private Payment is an option. Interface walkthrough: protect saved payment records with your passkey.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Add funds, then create a private link. MON wraps to WMON. Deposits and withdrawals are public; the proving service sees details.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:44.000
The mainnet pilot passed. 1 MON: deposit, private transfer, claim and recovery. Verified separately, not in this recording.
